  <title>编辑归档文件</title>

  <p>With <app>File Roller</app> you can edit an existing archive by adding
  new files, removing unwanted ones or by renaming them. You can work with
  folders in the same way as with files.</p>

  <terms>
    <item>
      <title>添加文件</title>
      <p>按照 <link xref="archive-create">创建归档</link> 的说明将文件添加到现有归档。</p>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>移除文件</title>
      <p>右键单击文件并选择 <gui style="menuitem">删除</gui>，或按下<key>删除</key>键。</p>
    </item>
    <item>
    <title>重命名文件</title>
      <p>右键单击文件并选择 <gui style="menuitem">重命名...</gui> 或按下 <key>F2</key> 键。在打开的对话框中输入新文件名并确认。</p>
    </item>
  </terms>

